        "id": 1934715
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-01-22T02:28:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I do agree that not having a custom `mmap()` handler would simplify things a bit. I\u0027ll dig into why that check for the VMA range was added in the ashmem driver and get back to you.",
      "parentUuid": "7a45197d_4ebdadef",
      "revId": "8f570371fbc828d6660f8da315d9fdb0ebc57827",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
